# Training tempo is locked

The tempo dropdown in `prototypes/strength-training-play.html` is frozen.

Do not redesign it unless the user explicitly reopens the lock. No tempo comes first. Add opens four labeled boxes. A saved tempo stays in the list, and a lift can keep no tempo.

`docs/training-tempo-lock.md` is the contract. `pnpm run check:training-play` must stay green. A reopened change updates both in the same commit.
